  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Requests a <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/List" target="_blank">list</a> of <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Agent" target="_blank">agents</a> currently in the <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Region" target="_blank">region</a>, limited by the <b>scope</b> parameter.</p>
  <p>Returns a list `<a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Key" target="_blank">[key</a> id0, <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Key" target="_blank">key</a> id1, ..., <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Key" target="_blank">key</a> idn]` or `<a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/String" target="_blank">[string</a> error_msg]` - returns avatar <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Key" target="_blank">keys</a> for all agents in the region limited to the area(s) specified by scope</p>
  <p>• integer</p>
  <p><a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Parameters/scope" target="_blank">scope</a></p>
  <p>–</p>
</p>
