        <td></td>
        <td><b>Important:</b> To check if an avatar is in the same sim, please check whether <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlGetAgentSize" target="_blank">llGetAgentSize</a> does NOT return <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/ZERO_VECTOR" target="_blank">ZERO_VECTOR</a>. It's much faster and easier than calling llGetAgentList and running through the list to compare a given key with each list item.</td>
